From: iamwrm <iamwrm@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 00:03:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(windows): support native remote attach (IV-0001)

Combine the complete IV-0001 ownership boundary:

- platform-neutral remote launcher and Windows named-pipe transport
- Win32 input and terminal-theme fixes
- fork update safeguards and remote attach timing diagnostics
